In this solution, we iterate over the list of numbers and calculate the total strength of the group of students we have seen so far. If we encounter a zero, we update our maximum strength and reset the total strength to zero. At the end, we update our maximum strength one last time with the total strength of the remaining students. If the maximum strength is still zero, we return the maximum number in the list as the maximum strength. Finally, we multiply the maximum strength by 1e9 to handle the constraint that the maximum strength should not exceed 10^18.

